# Customer360 Navigator - BP7 decision-engine service Dockerfile.dockerignore
# Build context is the project ROOT (see this directory's Dockerfile header). Named
# `Dockerfile.dockerignore` (not `.dockerignore`) so BuildKit applies it to THIS Dockerfile only -
# same convention as bp1/bp2/bp3/bp4/bp6's own, since this project has multiple Dockerfiles
# sharing one build context.
#
# Docker's own dockerignore negation rule: a `!pattern` cannot re-include a file whose PARENT
# DIRECTORY was itself excluded by an earlier pattern - only a file-pattern exclusion (e.g.
# `**/*.csv`, not a bare directory like `notebooks/`) can be safely negated back in afterward.
# Every exclusion below that this file later negates is therefore a file-pattern, never a bare
# directory path - matching bp6's own Dockerfile.dockerignore precedent exactly (see its own
# comments for the same rule stated there).

# Data - never belongs in a served image
data/

# BP7's own image serves ONLY its own two real Gate 5 artifacts (see Dockerfile's explicit COPY
# list) - every other real CSV/parquet anywhere else in the tree is excluded.
**/*.csv
!notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate5_full_population_decision_records.csv
**/*.parquet

# Notebooks themselves - not imported by the service at runtime
**/*.ipynb
**/*.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Every other real BP7 artifact (Gates 2/3/4/5 produced several JSON files this service never
# reads - only gate5_decision_layer_summary.json, carved back in below) - listed individually,
# never via a directory-level exclusion, matching bp6's own precedent for the identical reason.
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate2_rescoring_summary.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate3_bp2_bp3_correlation_check.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate3_decision_rule_benchmark_summary.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate3_disparate_impact_carry_forward_check.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate3_lr_diagnostic.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate4_bootstrap_ci.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate4_bp3_agreement_crosstab.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate4_contribution_decomposition_summary.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate4_disparate_impact_audit.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate4_leakage_reconfirmation.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate4_reproduction_check.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate4_statistical_validation_explainability_summary.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate6_governance_summary.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/gate6_fastapi_self_test_result.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/artifacts/policy.json
notebooks/bp7_customer_navigator_decision_engine/README.md

# Every other BP's own notebook tree - this image serves BP7 only
notebooks/00_hardware_benchmark/
notebooks/01_data_acquisition_profiling/
notebooks/bp1_customer_intent_classification/
notebooks/bp2_customer_friction_classification/
notebooks/bp3_complaint_escalation_prediction/
notebooks/bp4_customer_journey_analytics/
notebooks/bp5_root_cause_driver_analytics/
notebooks/bp6_genai_resolution_assistant/
notebooks/bp8_executive_product_analytics/

# Every BP's model artifacts - BP7 persists no model bundle of its own and needs none of anyone
# else's (see the Dockerfile's own header).
models/

# Docs, reports, packaging staging, logs - not needed to serve
docs/
reports/
github_repo/
kaggle/
linkedin/
logs/
powerbi/

# Tests - the image serves the app, it does not run its own test suite
tests/

# VCS / editor / cache noise
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

# This project's own doc/config files not needed at runtime
*.docx
README.md
LICENSE
LESSONS_LEARNED_APPLIED.md
desktop.ini
